comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T18:14:15.744Z",codex-agent,"Cause: rebuilding with the bumped SDK changes defineProjectProfile inference to retain readonly literal types, so the committed demoProfile declaration and source map drift. Preserve the source and regenerate dist plus CHANGELOG.md. The earlier local gate was blocked by inherited npm allow-scripts user configuration, so validation will use an isolated home and empty npm user configuration, matching CI identity isolation."
  "2026-10-26T18:40:42.381Z",codex-agent,"Complete local npm run release:check passed with 370/370 tests and zero failures, cancellations or skips. Generated npm and Bun projects, both published SDK consumer contracts, SDK drift refusals, build/typecheck, unchanged coverage thresholds, lint, duplication, docstrings, production audit, package dry run, changelog and release verifiers passed. Linked pm test typecheck passed. The regenerated declaration preserves the bumped SDK readonly literal inference without source casts or assertion changes. Bun run release:check is now running."
  "2026-10-26T18:51:24.177Z",codex-agent,"Bun run release:check also passed with 370/370 tests, zero failures, cancellations or skips. Both complete launcher gates passed unchanged coverage, real SDK consumer and generated npm/Bun project contracts, lint, duplication, documentation, package, audit, changelog and publishing checks. Regenerated dist and changelog are committed with this item and its history; release the claim for orchestrator verification without closing the item."
  "2026-10-27T10:55:02.156Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: The merged Dependabot PR contains the toolchain fix, tracker receipts and generated-output changes. Current-main files were inspected; exact-head CI success is recovered in a new comment, and changelog generation/check follows closure writes. The generated SDK-inferred declarations and declaration maps match a fresh build under the repository-pinned toolchain; no runtime behavior changes are introduced. Delivered by PR #162, merge commit 2d5e189f4e6c18e486b9c6495e8b1140c8fb27c2, merged_at 2026-10-26T18:59:35Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T10:55:07.410Z",codex-agent,"REST-verified original-head CI: a4e31e330eac495e19b58c4516d42cb39b8fe47d; test (22)=success https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/actions/runs/40381810574/job/121779732635; test (26)=success https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/actions/runs/40381810574/job/121779732213. Earlier failed attempts are preserved as failures."
  "2026-10-27T10:55:39.393Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main with `npm run build && git diff --exit-code -- dist` via the pinned pm linked runner: PASS. The focused command exited successfully. Focused current-main validation passes; the merged source/output corrections were inspected. REST confirms successful original-head CI at a4e31e330eac495e19b58c4516d42cb39b8fe47d. The generated SDK-inferred declarations and declaration maps match a fresh build under the repository-pinned toolchain; no runtime behavior changes are introduced."
  "2026-10-27T11:05:18.115Z",codex-agent,"Closure validation: health retains the same legacy provenance advisory as untouched main f3c6c79c520e3423b902fb4a5fd7eb995d92c931: provenance_value_domain_invalid:claude-code:role:single_digit:34. Existing item pm-ts-starter-health-legacy-1027 owns this advisory. Strict health is not clean; the original history bytes remain unchanged. Default health additionally reports the existing global extension version skew. No history repair or dependency change is performed."
